                                "sense_id": "0ac11a53-875d-3c9f-a149-aef42de601af",
                                "text": "With her own dried tongue, she bent to moisten into relaxation its indrawn blue lips, and breathing on the clenched, congested hands, tried as unavailingly to lessen their terrible tension."
                            }
                        ]
